@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Figure 2.4(c)  Awaited build worker and persisted outcomes
hide footbox
participant "Frontend" as P0
participant "Projects API" as P1
participant "Orchestrator" as P2
participant "Code / repo" as P3
participant "TestRunner" as P4
participant "Safe executor" as P5
participant "Docker" as P6
participant "Persistence" as P7
activate P1
P0 -> P1 : POST /{id}/build
P1 -> P1 : Check current spec + guided approval
activate P7
P1 -> P7 : save_project(BUILDING)
deactivate P7
activate P2
P1 ->> P2 : to_thread(execute_build)
activate P3
P2 -> P3 : initialize_project(); write memory metadata
deactivate P3
loop [ready tasks; bounded file generation]
activate P3
P2 -> P3 : execute_task(task, spec, tools)
P3 -> P3 : Scoped AgentToolContext -> repository write
P3 -->> P2 : Task result / source failure
deactivate P3
end
opt [all source tasks complete]
P2 -> P3 : create_checkpoint(code_complete)
activate P5
P2 -> P5 : preflight()
P5 -->> P2 : Runtime available / reason
deactivate P5
opt [runtime available]
activate P4
P2 -> P4 : Run backend, frontend, API and browser checks
activate P5
P4 -> P5 : execute(command_str)
activate P6
P5 -> P6 : docker run: read-only, network none
P6 -->> P5 : Exit code + stdout/stderr
deactivate P6
P5 -->> P4 : ExecutionResult
deactivate P5
P4 -->> P2 : All declared check results
deactivate P4
end
end
alt [all required checks pass]
P2 -->> P1 : VERIFIED report
else [else]
P2 -->> P1 : BLOCKED / FAILED / REQUIRES_HUMAN
end
deactivate P2
activate P7
P1 -> P7 : save_project(final state + report)
deactivate P7
P1 -->> P0 : HTTP response with build report
deactivate P1
note over P0,P7
API awaits shield(worker). Graph/scheduler are local. Orchestrator invokes SelfHealingLoop only after backend test failure.
end note
@enduml
